I recently started playing nethack again, but now I am playing on a
PC and not with some changes I had added, and I realized how much I
had missed them.

They are:
	1)	Identify, have the identify scroll ask which item to
		id not which class of items, and let you look at your
		inventory (by selecting * or ?) before identifying
		anything, and jump around if you are allowed to id
		more than one thing.

	2)	The same thing for putting something into a container.

	3)	Whenever nethack asked "What do you want to <...>
		[abd-gi-zA-D ?*]" have nethack also allow you to put
		a \ and a category code.  This allows you to throw,
		and then just look at the food items by responding \%.

I have, unfortunatly, forgotten what I had to do to make these changes,
however if there is enough interest, or the dev team wants them, I will
figure out what I did and post or mail the diff's.

